oper over <MATH_0016>, then the subfunctor\n<MATH_0017>\nis an algebraic space affine of finite presentation over <MATH_0018>.\nSee Quot, Proposition <REF_0002>.\n\n\n\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:447a57bfc6931a0cff544c12bde743532aebb23d2ba6daf05844b90113a03946", "unit_id": "tag:0DLW:prose-0001"}
